 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (9): Agents Of Black Sun / Vengeance Of The Dark Prince, Coruscant, Coruscant: Imperial City, Prince Xizor, Start Your Engines!, Boonta Eve Podrace, Watto's Box, Tatooine: Podrace Arena and Sebulba's Podracer; all counted in the 60.",
  "Posted 'Coruscant' dested the Dark Special Edition system Coruscant (Dark) (Special Edition) (the objective's starting system), as in other Vengeance Of The Dark Prince decks; 'Coruscant Docking Bay' dested the Special Edition Coruscant: Docking Bay; 'Death Star Docking Bay' dested Death Star: Docking Bay 327.",
  "Boonta Eve Podrace and Tatooine: Podrace Arena dested to their Dark pages (deployed by Start Your Engines!).",
  "Posted 'Price Xizor' (Characters) dested Prince Xizor; with the starting Xizor the list has two copies, kept as published.",
  "Posted 'IG-88 With Gun' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Stun Blaster (SO GOOD WITH JODO)' dested the Dark Stun Blaster (the parenthesis is a comment).",
  "Posted 'Twilek Advisor', 'Evader and Monnok', 'Sniper and Dark Strike' and 'Control and Set for Stun' dested Twi'lek Advisor and the combo interrupts Evader & Monnok, Sniper & Dark Strike and Control & Set For Stun.",
